Apologies for the late reply.</div>
<div class=3D"elementToProof" style=3D"text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; =
line-height: 20px; margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; font-family: &quot;=
Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"=
>
As discussed, we can offer two alternative approaches for the &quot;Affilia=
te&quot; wording under the Agreement:</div>
<div class=3D"elementToProof" style=3D"text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; =
line-height: 20px; margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; font-family: &quot;=
Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"=
>
<b>Option 1: standard definition for Affiliates:&nbsp;</b><br>
=A1=B0Affiliate=A1=B1 means, with respect to any entity, any other entity w=
hich directly or indirectly controls, is controlled by, or is under common =
control with, such entity, where =A1=B0control=A1=B1 means the ownership, d=
irectly or indirectly, of more than fifty per cent (50%)
 of the voting rights or equity interests of such entity, or the power to d=
irect or cause the direction of the management and policies of such entity,=
 whether through ownership, contract or otherwise.</div>
<div class=3D"elementToProof" style=3D"text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; =
line-height: 20px; margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; font-family: &quot;=
Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"=
>
<b>Option 2: Affiliates list could be updated:</b><br>
&quot;Affiliates&quot;, for the purposes of this Agreement, only those Affi=
liates expressly listed in Appendix [XX] shall be considered as Affiliates =
of COMPANY.</div>
<div class=3D"elementToProof" style=3D"text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; =
line-height: 20px; margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; font-family: &quot;=
Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"=
>
The Parties may update the list of Affiliates set out in Appendix [XX] from=
 time to time during the term of this Agreement by mutual written agreement=
. Any such update shall take effect from the date agreed between the Partie=
s and shall not affect any rights
 or obligations accrued prior to such update.&nbsp;</div>
<div class=3D"elementToProof" style=3D"text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; =
line-height: 20px; margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; font-family: &quot;=
Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"=
>
----</div>
<div class=3D"elementToProof" style=3D"text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; =
line-height: 20px; margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; font-family: &quot;=
Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"=
>
Please let us know which option you would prefer so that we can align the w=
ording with your commercial needs and revise the contract accordingly.</div=
>
<div class=3D"elementToProof" style=3D"text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; =
line-height: 20px; margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; font-family: &quot;=
